                                types. Default: ``false``.
                              - ``bool`` "fold_all_bool_parameters": Fold all bool parameters.
                                Default: ``false``.
                              - ``bool`` "fold_all_enum_parameters": Fold all enum parameters.
                                Default: ``false``.
                              - #mi::base::IInterface* "fold_parameters": A static or dynamic array
